    "F.2": "\\begin{aligned} p_m(K,T;u)&=Ke^{-rT}\\Phi(-d_2)-S_0\\Phi(-d_1),\\\\ d_1&=\\frac{\\log(S_0/K)+rT+I_m/2}{\\sqrt{I_m}},\\qquad d_2=d_1-\\sqrt{I_m}. \\end{aligned} \\tag{F.2}",
